invalid.ts:2:20 lint/nursery/noSinglePromiseInPromiseMethods  FIXABLE  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  ! This array passed to Promise.race() has only one element.
  
    1 │ /* should generate diagnostics */
  > 2 │ await Promise.race([value as Promise<number>]);
      │                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    3 │ await Promise.any([promise!]);
    4 │ async function run(promise: Promise<number>) { return await Promise.any<number>([promise!]); }
  
  i Promise.race() is meant to combine several promises. With only one element, the array is unnecessary, or another promise is missing from it.
  
  i If the array is complete, use the value directly, or pass it to Promise.resolve() if you need a promise.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
  i Unsafe fix: Await the value directly.
  
    2 │ await·Promise.race([value·as·Promise<number>]);
      │       ------------ -                        -  

